        ":question/problem": "Use the substitution $u=x^{2}$. Which integral is obtained?\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}} 4 x e^{x^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$",
